Batman Begins is a drama, crime, action film directed by Christopher Nolan.

3
00:12:21,176 --> 00:12:27,176
Driven by tragedy, billionaire Bruce Wayne dedicates his life to uncovering and
defeating the corruption that plagues his home, Gotham City.

4
00:16:28,235 --> 00:16:34,235
Unable to work within the system, he instead creates a new identity, a
symbol of fear for the criminal underworld - The Batman.

5
